"                                JavaProperties, C#, JavaScript, TypeScript, TSX,\n"
"                                Scheme, Guile, Lisp, EmacsLisp, librep, Rust,\n"
"                                Go, Ruby, Shell, awk, Lua, Modula-2, D, OCaml,\n"
